                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "NDA and stakeholder approvals needed before proceeding with automation projects to ensure all parties are aligned and data privacy is maintained. This includes obtaining necessary approvals from key stakeholders like Jugal and Syed Farooq.",
